msgid "Open Galaxy"
msgstr "Ouvrir Galaxy"

#: mapbox_help.py:30
msgid "On this device: Device › This Device › Remote Access › Set Up, then open its link on your phone."
msgstr "Sur cet appareil : Appareil › Cet appareil › Accès à distance › Configurer, puis ouvrez le lien sur votre téléphone."

#: mapbox_help.py:31
msgid "Paste both keys"
msgstr "Coller les deux clés"

#: mapbox_help.py:31
msgid "In Galaxy: Navigation & Maps › App Keys. The public key is for search, the secret one for routes."
msgstr "Dans Galaxy : Navigation & Maps › App Keys. La clé publique sert à la recherche, la clé secrète aux itinéraires."

#: mapbox_help.py:55
msgid "Not added · needed for place search and routes"
